https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=anpjEN9KeJ0  (Capo 0)

Interesting side bit.  Although Ringo is given full writing credit he admits he had a lot of help from George Harrison who had much of the song completed when he gave it to Ringo, including a "guiding vocal" of Harrison singing.  George also plays guitar on the song along with Stephen Stills on piano and other members of the group Badfinger.

TIP:  For the intro/outro you move from (D) to (Dsus2) in which you just lift off the middle finger, and from (D) to (D4) in which you just add your pinky to the 1st string/3rd fret.  Easy peasy. 


